# Docs stay out of deployments, except the asset ledger the history pages import at build time
# (lib/content/history/assets.ts). Same pattern as scripts/ below: open the folder, then re-include the one file.
docs/*
!docs/history-scrolls
docs/history-scrolls/*
!docs/history-scrolls/ASSET_LEDGER.json
# The folder stays out of deployments, except the one script the build itself runs (package.json "prebuild": it copies the LiteRT runtime and fetches the Motion Lab models).
